window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Cassie Beckson’s buried her family. Now, she’ll bury whoever is responsible.</p> <p>The cops call it an overdose, but Cassie knows it was murder. And she has a plan-get a job as bartender at the exclusive club her brother attended that fateful night and uncover the truth. What she finds is a secret society, and herself bound by magical contract to Dexter Marin, the club's hot owner. He says it's for her safety, but Cassie refuses to be distracted by him and she certainly isn't going to ask him for help. Not when he's on her short list of suspects.</p> <p>But Dex has other plans. Popping in unannounced, invading her thoughts, whisking her away. Using magic to protect her, at his own risk. It's fine. It's all fine. Cassie has a handle on it and there's no tool at her disposal she won't use to find the killer. And when she discovers the truth, along with a plot to expose Dex and his secret abilities, she has to make a choice. Vengeance or justice?</p> <p>*Ten percent of book proceeds will be donated to programs that benefit women*</p>"; 
